      "section": "opening",
      "slot": "opening",
      "text": "Aspose.BarCode FOSS for Python reads and writes barcodes in code128, code39, ean13, ean8, upca, upce, and qr formats. It converts barcode data to png and svg images using to_png and to_svg methods, and supports rendering to pdf via the PdfRenderer class. It accepts render options through RenderOptions and ResolvedRenderOptions to control scale, dpi, module width, and text visibility, and it raises BarcodeError, EncodingError, RenderingError, or SymbologyNotFoundError when operations fail."
    },
    {
      "fact_ids": [
        "example:001",
