      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "intro",
      "text": "Aspose.BarCode FOSS for Python provides barcode generation through the aspose_barcode_foss module, which exposes helper functions for specific symbologies and a generic generate function. The Barcode class returned by these helpers offers to_png, to_svg, and render methods for output."
    },
